{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0177hqVWJB9ef7gWkY8ahnRT","type":"tool_result","content":"---\nschema_version: 1\nkind: capability-leg\nclaim: derived\nid: LEG-REQUEST-101-DENIED\nseam_id: SEAM-REQUEST-ENFORCEMENT\nswimlane_id: LANE-REQUEST-ENFORCEMENT\nobservable_state: Request 101 is denied for a limit of 100\nproof: Boundary tests allow the first 100 requests and deny the next request once.\nrequires:\n- effective policy decision\nproduces:\n- allow-or-deny decision\ntasks:\n- id: T-20260802-request-101\n  title: Enforce the effective limit at request 101\n  goal: Apply one effective policy at the request boundary without off-by-one drift.\n  done_condition: Requests 1-100 are allowed and request 101 is denied for the same organization window.\n  effort: S\n  profile: standard\n---\n---\nschema_version: 1\nkind: swimlane\nclaim: derived\nid: LANE-DECISION-VISIBILITY\nname: Decision visibility lane\nowner: reliability-interface\nseam_id: SEAM-DECISION-VISIBILITY\nsource_seam_sha256: 057f084a730d3070a1d5a08c34707a47e1f0647e5ec3c2875ca08c9fa94ad2fb\nlegs:\n- LEG-DENIAL-REASON-VISIBLE\n---\n# Decision visibility lane\n\nThis is the single owning swimlane for `SEAM-DECISION-VISIBILITY`. Ownership is `reliability-interface`.\nSibling capability legs are ordered only by explicit dependencies or recorded\ncontention—not by their position in this file.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3e3cdbbf-4173-4b8f-87a0-59f2add0d6fa","uuid":"a105cffa-5771-4755-af4f-c82721e2311d","timestamp":"2026-09-15T11:04:33.705Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"---\nschema_version: 1\nkind: capability-leg\nclaim: derived\nid: LEG-REQUEST-101-DENIED\nseam_id: SEAM-REQUEST-ENFORCEMENT\nswimlane_id: LANE-REQUEST-ENFORCEMENT\nobservable_state: Request 101 is denied for a limit of 100\nproof: Boundary tests allow the first 100 requests and deny the next request once.\nrequires:\n- effective policy decision\nproduces:\n- allow-or-deny de